    cortex-config::it trust::a_project_may_turn_verification_down_and_never_choose_its_commands

[break] a-trusted-project-chooses-the-checks
rule: `verify.commands` is the user's alone: a repository proposes its checks in its shared profile, which each user accepts by hash.
